(4983006, 727130, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice shoot, it dose show great emotions.I know it is difficult to work with kids. The one suggestion or bother is the lack of definition or visibility of the eyes. It dose show great emotions. good work. -6-</td>', 'Nice shoot, it dose show great emotions.I know it is difficult to work with kids. The one suggestion or bother is the lack of definition or visibility of the eyes. It dose show great emotions. good work. -6-', '2008-10-01 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
