(4983052, 727182, 46778, '<td valign="top">Ah the teenage years. Great capture of the attitude. Nice lighting with the background and subject. Maybe a catch light in the eyes would be nice? -6-</td>', 'Ah the teenage years. Great capture of the attitude. Nice lighting with the background and subject. Maybe a catch light in the eyes would be nice? -6-', '2008-10-01 01:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
