(4983542, 725923, 90663, '<td valign="top">I think I would not have cropped the tip of the ear off but I really don''t find it that distracting.  Perhaps needed a reflector or something to lighten up the dark muzzle a bit, detail there seems lost, but you really captured the dog in a nice pose</td>', 'I think I would not have cropped the tip of the ear off but I really don''t find it that distracting.  Perhaps needed a reflector or something to lighten up the dark muzzle a bit, detail there seems lost, but you really captured the dog in a nice pose', '2008-10-01 03:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
