(4983785, 726811, 49109, '<td valign="top">So you''ve been to the Photokina, too. For the possibilities you had with the perfect lighting and model at the Hasselblad stand, the outcome is rather poor, it was asked for a portrait, but the least interesting in this shot is her face, she doesn''t even sem to care if you were shooting. Exposure is perfect, but white balance seems slightly off to me, a tad too warm.</td>', 'So you''ve been to the Photokina, too. For the possibilities you had with the perfect lighting and model at the Hasselblad stand, the outcome is rather poor, it was asked for a portrait, but the least interesting in this shot is her face, she doesn''t even sem to care if you were shooting. Exposure is perfect, but white balance seems slightly off to me, a tad too warm.', '2008-10-01 05:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
