(4984787, 726003, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  While distracting at first, the out of focus object on the viewer''s left (door?) seems to give the photo a sense of candidness.  The ceiling lights, however are just distracting.  I''d love to see this shot, done again, with a more "flat" background.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  While distracting at first, the out of focus object on the viewer''s left (door?) seems to give the photo a sense of candidness.  The ceiling lights, however are just distracting.  I''d love to see this shot, done again, with a more "flat" background.', '2008-10-01 13:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
