(4985076, 726709, 92546, '<td valign="top">would have loved to see a vert crop to get rid of some of the hair on the left. Great lighting, and a nice shot.</td>', 'would have loved to see a vert crop to get rid of some of the hair on the left. Great lighting, and a nice shot.', '2008-10-01 15:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
