(4985079, 727096, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I would have cropped a little differently though. Usually you want to have the most negative space in the direction the off-center subject is looking because you eyes tend to want to go in that direction too. Perfect lighting and contrast on your backdrop.</td>', 'Nicely done. I would have cropped a little differently though. Usually you want to have the most negative space in the direction the off-center subject is looking because you eyes tend to want to go in that direction too. Perfect lighting and contrast on your backdrop.', '2008-10-01 15:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
