(4986072, 726550, 46778, '<td valign="top">I like the shoot, It looks like you took time to compose it and thought about the setup well. The only draw back that I see that it dose not meet the specification of the challenge by begin a studio shoot. -5-</td>', 'I like the shoot, It looks like you took time to compose it and thought about the setup well. The only draw back that I see that it dose not meet the specification of the challenge by begin a studio shoot. -5-', '2008-10-01 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4986075, 726888, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The lighting is quite harsh however. I''d recommend using a diffuser to soften the light. Also you need move your model away from the background if you want the background to be pure white. Focus is a little soft too I am afraid. <br/> <br/>Nice pose though and she is definitely engaged with the camera.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The lighting is quite harsh however. I''d recommend using a diffuser to soften the light. Also you need move your model away from the background if you want the background to be pure white. Focus is a little soft too I am afraid.  Nice pose though and she is definitely engaged with the camera.', '2008-10-01 23:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
