(4989221, 726514, 17153, '<td valign="top">woa, scary. I woudn''t babysit her... great expression and color</td>', 'woa, scary. I woudn''t babysit her... great expression and color', '2008-10-03 08:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989222, 727031, 93565, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how it happened, but the focus on this shot is very strange in regards to what is and isn''t in focus- What I mean is that not all the things I would assume would be in focus together are. Aspects of this photo that are seemingly equidistant from the focal plane look to be at different levels of focus, almost as if certain aspects were selectively blurred. Maybe it''s just the world''s shallowest DoF. You aren''t, by any chance, that fellow with the D700 focus problems?<br/>Other than that, I really like this.</td>', 'I have no idea how it happened, but the focus on this shot is very strange in regards to what is and isn''t in focus- What I mean is that not all the things I would assume would be in focus together are. Aspects of this photo that are seemingly equidistant from the focal plane look to be at different levels of focus, almost as if certain aspects were selectively blurred. Maybe it''s just the world''s shallowest DoF. You aren''t, by any chance, that fellow with the D700 focus problems?Other than that, I really like this.', '2008-10-03 08:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
