(4990429, 725764, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and focus. The captured smile and attitude is excellent. It lacks ambiance. Above average.</td>', 'I like the lighting and focus. The captured smile and attitude is excellent. It lacks ambiance. Above average.', '2008-10-03 19:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990430, 727185, 97166, '<td valign="top">Well, we all know who this is.<br/> <br/>I''d suggest cutting back on the smoothing a bit, personally.  Also, coming out from the background can help cut down on the flash/strobe shadows.  <br/> <br/>What on earth did you need validation for? hehe</td>', 'Well, we all know who this is. I''d suggest cutting back on the smoothing a bit, personally.  Also, coming out from the background can help cut down on the flash/strobe shadows.   What on earth did you need validation for? hehe', '2008-10-03 19:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990431, 725580, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting, above average</td>', 'Interesting, above average', '2008-10-03 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990433, 726135, 3032, '<td valign="top">The technical quality is good, there is an attempt to a story but that''s all.</td>', 'The technical quality is good, there is an attempt to a story but that''s all.', '2008-10-03 19:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
