(4990436, 726967, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. The tattoos and hair color add to this. Don''t like the color tone, but idea and contrast are cool. 7</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. The tattoos and hair color add to this. Don''t like the color tone, but idea and contrast are cool. 7', '2008-10-03 19:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
