(4990628, 727096, 1135, '<td valign="top">Really nice. The only thing I would do different is to crop out some the negative space on the right. Ive found that if you are going to place the subject off center, have the extra space on the side that they are looking, moving etc. For me it adds a sense of curiosity, it teases me with what they me be seeing or where they may be going. Still its top notch and Im sure it will me prominent in the family photo album.</td>', 'Really nice. The only thing I would do different is to crop out some the negative space on the right. Ive found that if you are going to place the subject off center, have the extra space on the side that they are looking, moving etc. For me it adds a sense of curiosity, it teases me with what they me be seeing or where they may be going. Still its top notch and Im sure it will me prominent in the family photo album.', '2008-10-03 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990962, 726709, 82985, '<td valign="top">Obviously, basic rules prevent it, but separate from the challenge the stray hair near her left eye could be cloned out.  I point this out as the only minor flaw here--This is a GREAT image, and gets a 9.  I like the blurry and dynamic hair on the left side, and the straight, static hair on the right.  Almost like a split personality, or yin-yang sort of feel to it.  Nice.</td>', 'Obviously, basic rules prevent it, but separate from the challenge the stray hair near her left eye could be cloned out.  I point this out as the only minor flaw here--This is a GREAT image, and gets a 9.  I like the blurry and dynamic hair on the left side, and the straight, static hair on the right.  Almost like a split personality, or yin-yang sort of feel to it.  Nice.', '2008-10-04 03:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990963, 726159, 82985, '<td valign="top">While this is likely posed very carefully, it has a natural, easy, spontaneous feel.  9</td>', 'While this is likely posed very carefully, it has a natural, easy, spontaneous feel.  9', '2008-10-04 03:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
