(4990965, 726967, 82985, '<td valign="top">This seems to capture her personality very well--the right mood, lighting, and offset negative space works very well here.  9</td>', 'This seems to capture her personality very well--the right mood, lighting, and offset negative space works very well here.  9', '2008-10-04 03:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990966, 726986, 82985, '<td valign="top">started at a 7, bumping you up to an 8--I keep coming back to this image.  The slightly blue/cool tonality to the light here is well done--white balancing or warming it up would not suit this image at all.  She is bundled up, so cool lighting reinforces that.  Her eyes suggest she is about to smile or laugh, and the hint of a forming smile at her lips suggests some mystery about what she is thinking.....</td>', 'started at a 7, bumping you up to an 8--I keep coming back to this image.  The slightly blue/cool tonality to the light here is well done--white balancing or warming it up would not suit this image at all.  She is bundled up, so cool lighting reinforces that.  Her eyes suggest she is about to smile or laugh, and the hint of a forming smile at her lips suggests some mystery about what she is thinking.....', '2008-10-04 03:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
