(4991759, 727027, 61818, '<td valign="top">Assuming you are short on ''studio'' gear, I still think you could have made more of this shot.  Moving the kid a foot to the left in front of some empty wall instead of randomly sitting him in front of a door where the hinge sticks up out of his hat would have helped.  Cropping the photo so there is more subject and less living room.  Asking the kid to look at the camera maybe.  Picking up the piece of paper sitting on the floor behind him......</td>', 'Assuming you are short on ''studio'' gear, I still think you could have made more of this shot.  Moving the kid a foot to the left in front of some empty wall instead of randomly sitting him in front of a door where the hinge sticks up out of his hat would have helped.  Cropping the photo so there is more subject and less living room.  Asking the kid to look at the camera maybe.  Picking up the piece of paper sitting on the floor behind him......', '2008-10-04 19:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
