(4994009, 726431, 94265, '<td valign="top">Aww this is cute. Lovely wee model, the bathing bucket is a nice idea, only thing I''d change is to have the bucket and background slightly more different shades of red. That''s just me, though.</td>', 'Aww this is cute. Lovely wee model, the bathing bucket is a nice idea, only thing I''d change is to have the bucket and background slightly more different shades of red. That''s just me, though.', '2008-10-06 00:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
