(4994013, 725882, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and I like the calm colours, would''ve liked to see her smile.</td>', 'Very pretty and I like the calm colours, would''ve liked to see her smile.', '2008-10-06 00:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994014, 727048, 94265, '<td valign="top">Haha I love her expression!</td>', 'Haha I love her expression!', '2008-10-06 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994015, 725440, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the downward perspective and the title is genius.</td>', 'I like the downward perspective and the title is genius.', '2008-10-06 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994229, 727064, 65319, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting this challenge, but I''d give this one a 10!  She so closely resembles my little daughter, Lily, that I had to do a double take when I saw this one.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I''m not voting this challenge, but I''d give this one a 10!  She so closely resembles my little daughter, Lily, that I had to do a double take when I saw this one.  Good Luck!', '2008-10-06 02:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994265, 726896, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed in places and the focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'A little over exposed in places and the focus is a bit soft.', '2008-10-06 02:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994267, 726979, 66515, '<td valign="top">The colors (especially in the shirt) are quite oversaturated.</td>', 'The colors (especially in the shirt) are quite oversaturated.', '2008-10-06 02:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994269, 726486, 66515, '<td valign="top">For me this has a bit of a snapshot feel to it. It also looks like it was taken outdoors. The challenge is calling for a studio shot so while that doesn''t mean you need to have a studio per se, the shot should be taken inside with controlled lighting.</td>', 'For me this has a bit of a snapshot feel to it. It also looks like it was taken outdoors. The challenge is calling for a studio shot so while that doesn''t mean you need to have a studio per se, the shot should be taken inside with controlled lighting.', '2008-10-06 02:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994271, 727028, 66515, '<td valign="top">Some rather harsh shadows in this shot. Bring your subject away from the back ground and use a defuser to soften the light. It also looks like the flash was fired on camera. If possible, it would help to get the flash off camera.</td>', 'Some rather harsh shadows in this shot. Bring your subject away from the back ground and use a defuser to soften the light. It also looks like the flash was fired on camera. If possible, it would help to get the flash off camera.', '2008-10-06 02:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994272, 727166, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting here. I''d like to see a bit more of the face though. A tighter crop would also help as the face looks like its floating.</td>', 'Interesting lighting here. I''d like to see a bit more of the face though. A tighter crop would also help as the face looks like its floating.', '2008-10-06 02:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994277, 726975, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little boost in contrast would help here I think. Nice pose and the lighting is generally well controlled.</td>', 'A little boost in contrast would help here I think. Nice pose and the lighting is generally well controlled.', '2008-10-06 02:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994303, 726893, 64670, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame she''s not in focus, a lovely model.</td>', 'It''s a shame she''s not in focus, a lovely model.', '2008-10-06 03:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994305, 727104, 64670, '<td valign="top">Too blown out.  Additionally the angle is not flattering to your subject, I''d liked to have seen more of her pretty face.</td>', 'Too blown out.  Additionally the angle is not flattering to your subject, I''d liked to have seen more of her pretty face.', '2008-10-06 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994921, 727196, 23002, '<td valign="top">Lighting is nice and your model is beautiful.  I am not crazy about the background colour though, however I like that you used a background light to help separate her from it.  I think the only thing that I would like to see different other than the background colour, is that she is looking to far to the side, putting her eyes to the corner of the eye sockets which looks a little distracting.<br/> <br/>Overall a great portrait that I am sure Kaya loves very much. :)  7</td>', 'Lighting is nice and your model is beautiful.  I am not crazy about the background colour though, however I like that you used a background light to help separate her from it.  I think the only thing that I would like to see different other than the background colour, is that she is looking to far to the side, putting her eyes to the corner of the eye sockets which looks a little distracting. Overall a great portrait that I am sure Kaya loves very much. :)  7', '2008-10-06 12:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994923, 727064, 23002, '<td valign="top">A very pretty portrait of a nice young lady. :)<br/> <br/>The lighting is nice even though it is a bit flat.  Good modelling angle of her body and head.  I think it might be more effective if she was not sitting cross legged, so that her back was straighter and you could maybe make it head and shoulders only and not have to use the square crop.  <br/> <br/>The point at the bottom where you cropped with half of her legs and part of her hands cut off takes away from the top 3/4 of the photo which is wonderful.  Gets a nice 7 from me.</td>', 'A very pretty portrait of a nice young lady. :) The lighting is nice even though it is a bit flat.  Good modelling angle of her body and head.  I think it might be more effective if she was not sitting cross legged, so that her back was straighter and you could maybe make it head and shoulders only and not have to use the square crop.   The point at the bottom where you cropped with half of her legs and part of her hands cut off takes away from the top 3/4 of the photo which is wonderful.  Gets a nice 7 from me.', '2008-10-06 12:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994926, 727028, 23002, '<td valign="top">Cute model, but very harsh on camera flash combined with her putting her weight on her hands take away from the photo.  The flash causes the harsh lighting and the hard shadow behind her.  She does not look very comfortable having the photo taken.<br/> <br/>Great attempt, and you certainly have a good model to practice with.  Keep at it.</td>', 'Cute model, but very harsh on camera flash combined with her putting her weight on her hands take away from the photo.  The flash causes the harsh lighting and the hard shadow behind her.  She does not look very comfortable having the photo taken. Great attempt, and you certainly have a good model to practice with.  Keep at it.', '2008-10-06 13:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994940, 726053, 49773, '<td valign="top">Interesting light but I have the feeling that the drama is lost.</td>', 'Interesting light but I have the feeling that the drama is lost.', '2008-10-06 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994942, 726540, 23002, '<td valign="top">This is a very well done portrait.  I am not sure I agree with almost total side lighting, but it certainly can be argued that it adds to the masculine effect.  The background light is nice to keep the dark shirt separated from the backdrop.  Good expression and nice skin tones.   7</td>', 'This is a very well done portrait.  I am not sure I agree with almost total side lighting, but it certainly can be argued that it adds to the masculine effect.  The background light is nice to keep the dark shirt separated from the backdrop.  Good expression and nice skin tones.   7', '2008-10-06 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994955, 727113, 23002, '<td valign="top">Very sexy model.  Unfortunately the side lighting is not very flattering to your subject.  It would help to have a background light or a hair light separate her dark hair from the dark backdrop.  the low perspective is not flattering either, as it represents a position of power for your model, where a sexy lady is usually most effectively photographed from a higher vantage looking downwards to show a more sensuous look.  Finally her one eye does not have a catchlight so it seems a tad dark.<br/> <br/>Please do not take this as being totally discouraging to you, I think the warm tones are nice, the model is beatiful and there is a lot of potential here, it is just not quite there yet. :) 5</td>', 'Very sexy model.  Unfortunately the side lighting is not very flattering to your subject.  It would help to have a background light or a hair light separate her dark hair from the dark backdrop.  the low perspective is not flattering either, as it represents a position of power for your model, where a sexy lady is usually most effectively photographed from a higher vantage looking downwards to show a more sensuous look.  Finally her one eye does not have a catchlight so it seems a tad dark. Please do not take this as being totally discouraging to you, I think the warm tones are nice, the model is beatiful and there is a lot of potential here, it is just not quite there yet. :) 5', '2008-10-06 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994957, 726442, 98339, '<td valign="top">Boy are those some blue eyes!!! wow</td>', 'Boy are those some blue eyes!!! wow', '2008-10-06 13:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994962, 726053, 23002, '<td valign="top">whoa!  There is something about the loop earings that just do not go along well with the ultra closeup portrait like this.  I think the earings are more feminen and the photo shows a more stronger type of woman.  I would also lose the hand as it totally distracts from the image.<br/> <br/>The lighting is a bit flat but certainly had nice exposure and the white backdrop is nice.  Skin tones are bang on as well, and her eyes are very expressive.  As is this gets a 6, but without the hand it would be a point higher.</td>', 'whoa!  There is something about the loop earings that just do not go along well with the ultra closeup portrait like this.  I think the earings are more feminen and the photo shows a more stronger type of woman.  I would also lose the hand as it totally distracts from the image. The lighting is a bit flat but certainly had nice exposure and the white backdrop is nice.  Skin tones are bang on as well, and her eyes are very expressive.  As is this gets a 6, but without the hand it would be a point higher.', '2008-10-06 13:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994970, 725236, 23002, '<td valign="top">A great model with a very pleasant expression.  The hair and tilt of her head are nice.  The harsh shadow under her chin and the very flat lighting, as well as the very white skin tones take away from the image.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice shot with some obvious work put into it.</td>', 'A great model with a very pleasant expression.  The hair and tilt of her head are nice.  The harsh shadow under her chin and the very flat lighting, as well as the very white skin tones take away from the image. Overall a nice shot with some obvious work put into it.', '2008-10-06 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994979, 726375, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like that you are taking a chance with the bold directional lighting here.  Your exposure is bang on.  I am not so sure I like the side view so much, and I know that I find the hand distracting.  I do love the boldness of the lighting set up though.</td>', 'I like that you are taking a chance with the bold directional lighting here.  Your exposure is bang on.  I am not so sure I like the side view so much, and I know that I find the hand distracting.  I do love the boldness of the lighting set up though.', '2008-10-06 13:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994989, 724619, 23002, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps making this a vertical crop instead of horizontal would be more effective from my point of view.  Keeping her arms in the shot an the top of her head, is more important to me then the sides of the dress.</td>', 'I think perhaps making this a vertical crop instead of horizontal would be more effective from my point of view.  Keeping her arms in the shot an the top of her head, is more important to me then the sides of the dress.', '2008-10-06 13:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4994990, 725293, 23002, '<td valign="top">studio portrait?  wrong challenge perhaps?  better luck next time.</td>', 'studio portrait?  wrong challenge perhaps?  better luck next time.', '2008-10-06 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995004, 725908, 23002, '<td valign="top">I am not a big gun person so I will guess that is a shell casing supposedly flying out of the side of the gun?<br/> <br/>Nicely lit for the soldier''s head and helmut but the lighting on the hands make them stick out a bit too much.  I like that you tried to do something different.<br/> <br/>That being said, it is not going to pass as a studio portrait because even if I ignore what looks like trees behind him, we do not fire guns in the studio....so even though it is DNMC I will still score it a 5 because there is some obvious lighting going on here which took some work to set up. :)</td>', 'I am not a big gun person so I will guess that is a shell casing supposedly flying out of the side of the gun? Nicely lit for the soldier''s head and helmut but the lighting on the hands make them stick out a bit too much.  I like that you tried to do something different. That being said, it is not going to pass as a studio portrait because even if I ignore what looks like trees behind him, we do not fire guns in the studio....so even though it is DNMC I will still score it a 5 because there is some obvious lighting going on here which took some work to set up. :)', '2008-10-06 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995011, 726515, 23002, '<td valign="top">For one light this is very nicely lit.  The model has beatiful skin and very expressive eyes.  My only two nit picks are the horizontal crop which cuts off the top of her head while leaving extra space on the sides to show what is on the left side of the image very distracting. (nothing wrong with a portrait in horizontal crop if it works for the image...just not this one)<br/> <br/>Overall you did great with your umbrella! 6</td>', 'For one light this is very nicely lit.  The model has beatiful skin and very expressive eyes.  My only two nit picks are the horizontal crop which cuts off the top of her head while leaving extra space on the sides to show what is on the left side of the image very distracting. (nothing wrong with a portrait in horizontal crop if it works for the image...just not this one) Overall you did great with your umbrella! 6', '2008-10-06 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995014, 725063, 23002, '<td valign="top">sorry, not a studio portrait.</td>', 'sorry, not a studio portrait.', '2008-10-06 13:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995017, 726099, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but would be more effective if she was not straight on to the camera.  Well exposed and the props are awesome.</td>', 'Great concept, but would be more effective if she was not straight on to the camera.  Well exposed and the props are awesome.', '2008-10-06 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995020, 726410, 23002, '<td valign="top">obviously not a colour studio portrait and it is suffering from compression artifacts.</td>', 'obviously not a colour studio portrait and it is suffering from compression artifacts.', '2008-10-06 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995024, 726486, 23002, '<td valign="top">sorry, not a studio portrait. :(</td>', 'sorry, not a studio portrait. :(', '2008-10-06 13:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995032, 726975, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great model and nice soft light.  However the black outfit blends into the background so she looks like a floating head, and the dark part of her hair blends in as well.  You could really use a background light here or a lighter colour backdrop.</td>', 'Great model and nice soft light.  However the black outfit blends into the background so she looks like a floating head, and the dark part of her hair blends in as well.  You could really use a background light here or a lighter colour backdrop.', '2008-10-06 13:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995042, 724646, 23002, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why you left the glasses on her when in basic editing you cannot clone out the reflections of the softbox?  I like the fact that this is a different take from most of the others though. :)</td>', 'I am not sure why you left the glasses on her when in basic editing you cannot clone out the reflections of the softbox?  I like the fact that this is a different take from most of the others though. :)', '2008-10-06 13:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995050, 725352, 23002, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model.  Howeer the severe cropping ruins the image.  Also her head is turned so far that you cannot make out the catch light in her one eye so it looks strange.  Do a less severe crop and have her turn her head a bit more toward the camera and it would be very nice.  Also I wonder why you did not go with a total white background on such a high key image?<br/> <br/>Overall I appreciate the effort that went into this, even if it does not totally do it for me...with some minor adjustment this could have been outstanding. :)</td>', 'Beautiful model.  Howeer the severe cropping ruins the image.  Also her head is turned so far that you cannot make out the catch light in her one eye so it looks strange.  Do a less severe crop and have her turn her head a bit more toward the camera and it would be very nice.  Also I wonder why you did not go with a total white background on such a high key image? Overall I appreciate the effort that went into this, even if it does not totally do it for me...with some minor adjustment this could have been outstanding. :)', '2008-10-06 13:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995054, 725543, 23002, '<td valign="top">Nice model, however the ultra harsh lighting totally contrast with the sexy outfit and pose of your model.</td>', 'Nice model, however the ultra harsh lighting totally contrast with the sexy outfit and pose of your model.', '2008-10-06 13:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4995068, 726003, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this, although it is a tad overexposed on the window side.  It would have been much more effective as a vertical crop so her head was not cut off and there would not be all the empty space on the sides that does nothing for the image at all except fight for the viewers attention.<br/> <br/>Darn..if this shot was just of her with taht expression and lighting without the extra large space at the sides and with all of her head this would have been an amazing capture.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this, although it is a tad overexposed on the window side.  It would have been much more effective as a vertical crop so her head was not cut off and there would not be all the empty space on the sides that does nothing for the image at all except fight for the viewers attention. Darn..if this shot was just of her with taht expression and lighting without the extra large space at the sides and with all of her head this would have been an amazing capture.', '2008-10-06 13:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
