(4997266, 724856, 94265, '<td valign="top">That is the cutest damn baby expression ever. Great vibrant colours, the wee guy probably thinks he''s tripping! ''Like woah dude, the colours....the colours, man!''  ;P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-12 21:28:08.</i></td>', 'That is the cutest damn baby expression ever. Great vibrant colours, the wee guy probably thinks he''s tripping! ''Like woah dude, the colours....the colours, man!''  ;P', '2008-10-07 18:18:57.000000', '2008-10-12 22:28:08.000000', 1),
