(4997342, 725466, 94265, '<td valign="top">I feel the pic has been oversoftened just a wee bit, particularly noticeable on the lips but she''s a very pretty girl, the green background matching the necklace is a nice touch.</td>', 'I feel the pic has been oversoftened just a wee bit, particularly noticeable on the lips but she''s a very pretty girl, the green background matching the necklace is a nice touch.', '2008-10-07 19:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
