(4999924, 726890, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Keep working on that smirk. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I had better smirk photos but the head tilt and angles on this one were a better fit, it was hard to get the details even close (I do not lean that direction), I even made sure to cut the thumb out of the shot which gat a negative comment but matches the profile pic. The other problem was I did not realize I was leaning the wrong direction and had to flip the photo which is why the lettering on the hat is backwards. <br/> <br/>Fun shots uassually do not score well.......<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Keep working on that smirk. :)   I had better smirk photos but the head tilt and angles on this one were a better fit, it was hard to get the details even close (I do not lean that direction), I even made sure to cut the thumb out of the shot which gat a negative comment but matches the profile pic. The other problem was I did not realize I was leaning the wrong direction and had to flip the photo which is why the lettering on the hat is backwards.  Fun shots uassually do not score well.......', '2008-10-08 15:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
