(5002248, 727028, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a difference a day makes...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=418588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/577/120/418588.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/577/120/418588.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/577/120/418588.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Wait...that was 2 years ago. OH MY GOSH...!!!<br/> <br/>For this one, I believe you were right and the voters were wrong: for the most part. I believed that this photo was way more ''Color Studio Portrait'' then many of the photos that scored higher. Yes, they may have been better photos but I didn''t see them as something somebody would do in a studio nor as a true portrait. Your lighting is a little bright but I think you got ''Studio Portrait'' over many of the other photos. Keep up the great work and it''s good to see your still at it!</td>', 'Wow, what a difference a day makes...   Wait...that was 2 years ago. OH MY GOSH...!!! For this one, I believe you were right and the voters were wrong: for the most part. I believed that this photo was way more ''Color Studio Portrait'' then many of the photos that scored higher. Yes, they may have been better photos but I didn''t see them as something somebody would do in a studio nor as a true portrait. Your lighting is a little bright but I think you got ''Studio Portrait'' over many of the other photos. Keep up the great work and it''s good to see your still at it!', '2008-10-09 22:38:38.000000', NULL, 0),
