(5003245, 727027, 39057, '<td valign="top">EDIT: Oops I didn''t see where he honored you in the photographs discription!<br/> <br/>Richard must be mellowing out....<br/> <br/>...a few months ago he would have danced all over your face for making a comment like this !<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rugman1969:</b></div><hr/><i> You calling us uptight?  That is pretty rude to do because you can''t get the votes like you do on DA.  I thought better of you than this, for you to stoop to this level because many here do not vote the way you would like them to.  I can only say while I do not agree with the majority a lot of the time, when a picture is not good, it''s just not good, and this picture is not good.    You are more than welcome to report me to SC again, but after they read your comment, I think they will agree this response is deserved. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-10 17:06:37.</i></td>', 'EDIT: Oops I didn''t see where he honored you in the photographs discription! Richard must be mellowing out.... ...a few months ago he would have danced all over your face for making a comment like this ! Originally posted by rugman1969: You calling us uptight?  That is pretty rude to do because you can''t get the votes like you do on DA.  I thought better of you than this, for you to stoop to this level because many here do not vote the way you would like them to.  I can only say while I do not agree with the majority a lot of the time, when a picture is not good, it''s just not good, and this picture is not good.    You are more than welcome to report me to SC again, but after they read your comment, I think they will agree this response is deserved. ', '2008-10-10 17:56:31.000000', '2008-10-10 18:06:37.000000', 0),
