(5422052, 726411, 26001, '<td valign="top">This is such an excellent portrait. Tones, angle, expressions, subject...everything is just right. I am a bit surprised by the score here though.<br/>I always like weird portraits. Some are weird enough that I have to settle for SPs because no one in their right mind will pose for them. If you visit my web-site, you will notice that .</td>', 'This is such an excellent portrait. Tones, angle, expressions, subject...everything is just right. I am a bit surprised by the score here though.I always like weird portraits. Some are weird enough that I have to settle for SPs because no one in their right mind will pose for them. If you visit my web-site, you will notice that .', '2009-04-06 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
